WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
MARMALADE BOY

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.786
But it's still on my mind

00:00:14.786 --> 00:00:16.754
This morning,
more so than before...

00:00:18.056 --> 00:00:21.389
A dream was interrupted

00:00:21.527 --> 00:00:24.758
I want to know how it ends for...
him and me

00:00:31.203 --> 00:00:36.436
Ah, God, please stop time

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:40.036
Can't ﬁnd my books...
school uniform...

00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:43.011
My hair won't dry yet

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, help me... my ribbon
doesn't seem to go on right

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
All because I dreamt of him

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.295
When I bit into my
half—burnt piece of toast...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
All of a sudden
my heart started pounding

00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:15.545
Sweet and bitter marmalade

00:01:15.681 --> 00:01:18.149
That's why it's on my mind

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Why am I feeling this way?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Alll want is

00:01:25.457 --> 00:01:28.949
to see his smile

00:03:03.188 --> 00:03:11.152
ANJU'S FEELINGS —
"I DON'T MIND
BEING SECOND TO MIKI."

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.484
MARMALADE BOY

00:09:54.632 --> 00:09:57.260
MARMALADE BOY

00:17:07.732 --> 00:17:09.996
I LOVE YOU

00:22:11.435 --> 00:22:12.299
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:34.058 --> 00:22:36.993
A BITTER LOVE —
"I'VE LOVED YUU
FOR A LONG TIME."

00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:57.905
Until I can see you

00:22:58.048 --> 00:23:05.352
In the falling leaves

00:23:05.489 --> 00:23:13.396
I am trying to warm

00:23:14.064 --> 00:23:21.994
The half—cold cup of coffee

00:23:22.139 --> 00:23:25.199
I'm waiting for you, girl

00:23:25.342 --> 00:23:30.939
I feel like I have been
waiting for you

00:23:31.081 --> 00:23:37.884
Ever since I was born

00:23:38.022 --> 00:23:40.889
Just waiting for your love

00:23:41.025 --> 00:23:46.964
I want to be buried
in this feeling of love

00:23:47.097 --> 00:23:54.367
That grows stronger over time
